            <ArticleTitle>New advances in the management of endodontic pain emergencies.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>469-73</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The development of more effective strategies for managing endodontic pain emergencies draws from the research of both clinicians and basic scientists. This review explores evidence-based approaches for managing endodontic pain emergencies and newly emerging pain management strategies based upon molecular, cellular and physiologic research into pain mechanisms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
